  "pseudocode": "1. target = sum(nums) / k\n2. sort(nums, desc)\n3. function backtrack(idx, currentSum, k):\n4.   if k == 1 return true\n5.   if currentSum == target: return backtrack(0, 0, k-1)\n6.   for i from idx to n:\n7.     if !used[i] and currentSum + nums[i] <= target:\n8.       used[i] = true\n9.       if backtrack(i + 1, currentSum + nums[i], k): return true\n10.      used[i] = false\n11. return false",
